    {"lyric": "Ije neoraneun jidoreul hwaljjak pyeolchilge", "lyric_hangul": "이제 너라는 지도를 활짝 펼칠게", "lyric_translation": "Now I’ll spread out my map to you", "range": [105.84, 108.01], "ans": [4]},
